    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Cosy Space-Rover Photography Game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help a new space colony conduct research on large spherical planets, by documenting elements of alien worlds through photography.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ROVA is a game about discovery and exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Space photography </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Large spherical planets to explore, with a range of biomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A strong 3D line-art style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Day/Night Cycles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Colonists with day schedules you can follow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 'Observation/study mode' - enjoy a range of lofi songs whilst observing colonists perform their daily routines</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930130/extras/6ada25820874237cc78f0df49a791706.avif?t=1749056421\" data-has-big width=800 height=458 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Cosy Space-Rover Photography Game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help a new space colony conduct research on large spherical planets, by documenting elements of alien worlds through photography.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ROVA is a game about discovery and exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Space photography </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Large spherical planets to explore, with a range of biomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A strong 3D line-art style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Day/Night Cycles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Colonists with day schedules you can follow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 'Observation/study mode' - enjoy a range of lofi songs whilst observing colonists perform their daily routines</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930130/extras/6ada25820874237cc78f0df49a791706.avif?t=1749056421\" data-has-big width=800 height=458 /></span></p>",
